  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 513.67 Conservation Number Plates",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 513.67 Conservation Number Plates.\n\n(a) A special conservation plate or special vanity conservation plate shall be issued to vehicles, in lieu of other plate types, pursuant to RSA 261:97-a.\n\n(b) Plates shall be renewed on an annual basis for $30 per set.\n\nSource. #10135, eff 5-23-12; renumbered by #12914 (formerly Saf-C 514.66); ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 514.67)\n\nSaf 513.68 Special Registration Plate Symbol. Pursuant to RSA 261:75-c, a special registration plate symbol shall be issued, upon request, to private passenger vehicles, recreational vehicles, and motorcycles for the purpose of benefitting the state park system. The special registration plate symbol shall serve as a character in the registration number and issued in accordance with the requirements of RSA 261:75-c.\n\nSource. #10135, eff 5-23-12; renumbered by #12914 (formerly Saf-C 514.67); ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 514.68)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
